<title>CHILE: Chile's Aninat sets news conference.</title>
<headline>Chile's Aninat sets news conference.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean Finance Minister Eduardo Aninat will have a news conference at 5:15 p.m. (3:15 p.m. EST) to discuss the Chile-Canada free trade agreement, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>Canadian Foreign Trade Minister Art Eggleton said in Ottawa some last-minute ''hiccups'' had prevented conclusion of the agreement.</p>
<p>--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211</p>
</text>
